# 1. Project Overview

**Project Name:** Milaak / مِلاك  
**Project Type:** Cross-platform mobile application  
**Business Domain:** Property management / rental operations  
**Primary Purpose:** Local-first Arabic mobile app for managing properties, units, tenants, lease contracts, rent schedules, payments, utility bills, maintenance tickets, documents, reminders, and financial reports.  
**Target Users:** Individual landlords and small property offices.  
**Main Business Value:** Centralizes rental operations in an offline-capable mobile app using local SQLite storage, reducing manual tracking across paper, spreadsheets, and messaging apps.

